    "description": "\ud83c\udf4b ABOUT US:\r\n\r\nFind something fresh - friends, dates, and everything in between.\r\nAt Yuzu, we\u2019re always on the lookout for connections that refresh our vibe, expand our circles, and revive our sense of belonging.\r\nBecause nothing is more invigorating than being your truest self and discovering people who are too. \r\nSo whether you\u2019re down to chill Monday, feeling spontaneous Friday, or seeking serenity Sunday, the juiciest connections have yet to be made. Join Yuzu.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf4b KEY FEATURES:\r\n\u2022 Social - Make new friends, with cultural connection\r\n\u2022 Dating: Find someone who speaks the language of your heart \r\n\u2022 Community: Discover a community who gets every part of you",
